{"video":"tXWE7AJz1l4","lines":[{"t":[0,1],"en":"I'm getting married today!"},{"t":[1,2],"en":"What?"},{"t":[2,3],"en":"Oh!"},{"t":[3,4],"en":"Oh!"},{"t":[4,5],"en":"Just kidding."},{"t":[5,7],"en":"I think you just cracked a rib."},{"t":[7,10],"en":"But I don't care, because today is my wedding day!"},{"t":[10,15],"en":"My day is finally here!"},{"t":[15,19],"en":"You know, she might not even notice he's gone."},{"t":[19,22],"en":"I'm gonna start getting ready!"},{"t":[22,25],"en":"God, we can't let her start getting ready!"},{"t":[25,26],"en":"This is too awful!"},{"t":[26,27],"en":"Shh!"},{"t":[27,29],"en":"Oh, God, but wait, she'll be in the gown,"},{"t":[29,31],"en":"and then he won't show up,"},{"t":[31,33],"en":"and then she's gonna have to take off the gown!"},{"t":[33,34],"en":"Shh! Stop it! Stop it, Rachel!"},{"t":[34,36],"en":"You can't do this here!"},{"t":[36,39],"en":"I'm sorry."},{"t":[39,40],"en":"I'm sorry."},{"t":[40,42],"en":"It's just so sad!"},{"t":[42,44],"en":"You've got to pull yourself together."},{"t":[44,46],"en":"Monica can't see you like this."},{"t":[46,47],"en":"Then she'll know something's wrong."},{"t":[47,48],"en":"I know! I know!"},{"t":[48,50],"en":"Oh, God!"},{"t":[50,52],"en":"There's no tissue!"},{"t":[52,54],"en":"Can you grab me some toilet paper?"},{"t":[54,55],"en":"Oh, that's gone, too."},{"t":[55,57],"en":"This is Monica's bathroom, right?"},{"t":[57,59],"en":"Oh!"},{"t":[59,60],"en":"No, no, I found one."},{"t":[60,61],"en":"Oh, okay."},{"t":[65,66],"en":"Oh, thank you."},{"t":[71,72],"en":"Can I have another one?"},{"t":[74,75],"en":"Sure."},{"t":[78,79],"en":"Do you need some floss?"},{"t":[79,80],"en":"Oh, God."},{"t":[80,85],"en":"I just cannot imagine what is gonna happen if Chandler doesn't show up."},{"t":[85,87],"en":"Oh, here's a whole bunch."},{"t":[87,88],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[88,90],"en":"I mean, she's gonna be at the wedding waiting for him,"},{"t":[90,92],"en":"and people will be whispering,"},{"t":[92,93],"en":"\"Oh, that poor girl.\""},{"t":[93,94],"en":"You know?"},{"t":[94,97],"en":"And then she'll have to come back here and live all alone."},{"t":[97,98],"en":"Oh, my God."},{"t":[98,99],"en":"What?"},{"t":[99,102],"en":"There was a pregnancy test in the garbage."},{"t":[103,104],"en":"And it's positive."},{"t":[106,107],"en":"Monica's pregnant."},{"t":[110,112],"en":"So I guess she won't be totally alone."}]}
